  "body": "When calling `whenDefined` and passing a **nonexistent custom element name**, the promise is never fulfilled.\r\n\r\nFor instance:\r\n\r\n```js\r\ncustomElements.whenDefined('invalid-element')\r\n  .then(() => { alert('success'); })\r\n  .catch(() => { alert('fail'); });\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis can cause some websites to never be initiated if they rely on the Promise to be fulfilled.\r\n\r\nTested on:\r\nChrome 108.0\r\nFirefox 107.0\r\n\r\nAPI spec:\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#custom-elements-api\r\n",
